!! Real-world example: Software project map

This map shows the major concerns of a full-stack software project radiating from the project root, with technology choices as leaf nodes.

```
mindmap
  %% ── Root ───────────────────────────────────
  root((Project))
    %% ── Frontend branch ────────────────────
    Frontend
      React
      CSS
      Accessibility
    %% ── Backend branch ─────────────────────
    Backend
      REST API
      Auth
      Database
        PostgreSQL
        Redis
    %% ── DevOps branch ──────────────────────
    DevOps
      CI/CD
      Docker
      Monitoring
    %% ── Docs branch ────────────────────────
    Docs
      README
      API Reference
      Changelog
```

